export anchor VideoEditor:
    description:
        Brightwork Cut, a made-up video editor, editing the project Launch
        teaser at 1080p and 24 fps. On a phone it shows the viewer and a
        simplified timeline.

    viewer:
        The program monitor at 00:00:18:12 of 00:01:30:00, showing a title card
        "Every project, on one calm page", with play controls.

    bin:
        - hero-motion.mp4, 00:42
        - office-broll-03.mov, 01:15
        - voiceover-take4.wav, 01:22
        - music-low-tide.wav, 02:40
        - logo-sting.mov, 00:04

    timeline:
        Tracks V2 titles, V1 video, A1 voiceover and A2 music, with clips laid
        along a ruler from 0 to 90 seconds, a playhead at 18 seconds, and a
        marker named "cut to logo" at 84 seconds.

    inspector:
        For the selected title clip, position 960 by 540, scale 100 percent,
        opacity 100 percent, and a cross dissolve of 12 frames.

    export:
        An Export button and a render bar at 0 percent.
